Package: inferno
Title: INFERNO Evaluation Protocol
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ed", "Phil", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ed@phosphene.io"),
    person("Flow", role = "aut",
           email = "flow@ind.media")
  )
Description: Formal 7-layer evaluation protocol for research claims,
    using Formal Concept Analysis (fcaR), Jensen-Shannon divergence,
    and content-addressable storage. Implements the INFERNO (Inductive
    Framework for Evaluating Research through Normalized Ontologies)
    method for assessing epistemic weight, confidence, and
    integrability of scientific claims.
